        "You keep your clothes. The inner room stays a darker mouth you did not enter, or entered only with your eyes. Crowe accepts it with a revision in her gaze, the same look she gave an untouched glass. \"Very well,\" she says. \"The tape remains a future tense. The rehearsal remains a dog. The clinic remains a calendar I can write without you. The gala remains a mark on a floor. You have bought a night of not being fucked on the record. I will sell it to you at the price of everything else being slightly worse.\"\n\nShe writes something on the tablet. You do not see the words. You can guess the verbs. A night of not being fucked on the record costs everything else being slightly worse. She writes verbs you cannot see. You can guess them. Guessing is still a leash.",
        "\"Vale will still want you. If you sold me Voss, he will want you slower. If you refused me, he will want you sooner, because refusal is a stack he enjoys sanding. If you only heard the terms, you are in the middle, which is a liaison's habit, and we have discussed the middle.\"\n\nShe walks you to the door herself, a courtesy that is also a camera angle. \"South lift. Maren will not ride with you tonight. She is angry, or she is writing, or she is both. If you call your handler, remember what you did or did not sell. I keep purchases. I keep refusals too. They age.\"\n\nThe seal opens. You have not been taken. You have been invoiced. The difference will not help you sleep. It may help you walk as far as the tram.",
